      "content": "what do you mean \"a reason that ends right now\"? that sounded really heavy. like you're saying the only way to find dignity is to just... stop? it's just so exhausting to keep trying when there's nothing waiting for us. it feels like there's no way out of the cycle besides just giving up.",
